config 88XXAU
	tristate "Realtek 8812AU/8811AU/8821AU/8814AU USB WiFi (rtl88xxau)"
	depends on USB && CFG80211
	help
	  Out-of-tree aircrack-ng/rtl8812au driver (v5.6.4.2) for Realtek
	  RTL8811AU/8812AU/8821AU/8814AU USB adapters (e.g. TP-Link Archer
	  T2U V3, Alfa AWUS036ACH). Supports monitor mode and injection.
